HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The ffuussee driver was written as the part of the FreeBSD implementation of
     the FUSE userspace file system framework (see
     hhttttppss::////ggiitthhuubb..ccoomm//lliibbffuussee//lliibbffuussee) and first appeared in the
     _s_y_s_u_t_i_l_s_/_f_u_s_e_f_s_-_k_m_o_d port, supporting FreeBSD 6.0.  It was added to the
     base system in FreeBSD 10.0, and renamed to ffuusseeffss for FreeBSD 12.1.

